                  "text": "Hi there,<br><br>This time of year always reminds me why we started: to make travelling a little easier, a little calmer, and a lot more enjoyable.<br><br>Whether you’re heading home, going somewhere new or just getting through the airport, thank you for bringing us along. Your stories and photos keep us going.<br><br>Our biggest sale of the year is on. <strong>Take 25% off everything, plus an extra 10% when you spend $750 or more.*</strong> A few of my favourites:<br><br>•&nbsp; <strong><a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">The Metal Carry-On</a></strong>: makes even a short work trip feel nicer<br>•&nbsp; <strong><a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">The Kids’ Set</a></strong>: my two love pulling their own cases<br>•&nbsp; <strong><a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">The Weekender</a></strong>: the lightest bag we make<br><br>Here’s to easy journeys and full suitcases.<br><br>Warmly,<br>Maya Lund<br>Founder, Wayfare",
